What the MIT license above covers, and what it doesn't

The MIT license applies to the source code in this repository: src/, api/,
scripts/, contracts/src, contracts/test, contracts/script, and the build
configuration.

It does NOT apply to:

- The Ronke the Monke character and artwork (public/ronke/, public/og.jpg,
  and the Ronke likeness in public/sea/). Ronke belongs to the Ronke
  community and its creators; this repository grants no rights to it.
- The game art and sounds in public/sea/ and public/sounds/ (all rights
  reserved).
- Third-party files, which keep their own licenses: the Baloo 2 font
  (public/fonts/, SIL Open Font License 1.1), MediaPipe's face landmarker
  model and runtime (public/mediapipe/, Apache License 2.0), and the
  Solidity libraries under contracts/lib/ (see the LICENSE files there).
